Four-state Ehrenfest trajectory with a fixture shell backend.

&general
pot='mock-eh',
mdtype='ehrenfest',
irest=0,
irandom=123,
nstep=5,
dt=20.0,
nwrite=1,
nwritex=1,
nwritef=1,
xyz_units='bohr',
/

&thermostat
inose=0,
rem_comvel=.false.,
rem_comrot=.false.,
scaleveloc=0,
/

&eh
nstate=4,
istate_init=4,
substep=100,
integ='rk4',
nac_accu1=7,
nac_accu2=5,
/
